        <target state="translated">位置</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="TabStripReorderDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Enable drag sorting with IsTabReorderEnabled. The selected item follows the same logical tab after sorting.</source>
        <target state="translated">透過 IsTabReorderEnabled 開啟拖曳排序。排序後選中狀態會跟隨同一個邏輯標籤項。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="TabStripReorderPlacementDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Switch TabStripPlacement to verify drag sorting on horizontal and vertical tab tracks.</source>
        <target state="translated">切換 TabStripPlacement，驗證水平與垂直標籤軌道下的拖曳排序效果。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="TabStripReorderPlacementTitle">
      <segment>
        <source>Draggable tabs with placement</source>
        <target state="translated">不同位置的拖曳排序</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="TabStripReorderTitle">
      <segment>
        <source>Draggable tabs</source>
        <target state="translated">拖曳排序</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="TabStripSizeDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Large size tabs are usually used in page header, and small size could be used in Modal.</source>
        <target state="translated">大尺寸標籤通常用於頁頭，小尺寸可用於模態框。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="TabStripSizeTitle">
