    </unit>
    <unit id="TabStripSlideDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>In order to fit in more tabs, they can slide left and right (or up and down).</source>
        <target state="translated">為了容納更多標籤，標籤可以左右滑動（或上下滑動）。</target>
